       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PROBERATES.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  WS-PRODUCT       PIC X(4).
       77  WS-BAL-STR       PIC X(20).
       77  WS-BALANCE        PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
       77  WS-INTEREST       PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
       77  WS-RATE-TIER      PIC 9(1).
       77  WS-DISP-INT       PIC -(9)9.99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           ACCEPT WS-PRODUCT FROM ENVIRONMENT "PRODUCT"
           ACCEPT WS-BAL-STR FROM ENVIRONMENT "BALANCE"
           COMPUTE WS-BALANCE = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-BAL-STR)

           CALL "CALCRATE" USING WS-PRODUCT WS-BALANCE
                                  WS-INTEREST WS-RATE-TIER

           MOVE WS-INTEREST TO WS-DISP-INT
           DISPLAY "INTEREST=" WS-DISP-INT " TIER=" WS-RATE-TIER
           GOBACK.
